## 🛠️ Technical Stack

### Frontend
- **Framework**: Next.js 16 (App Router)
- **Styling**: Tailwind CSS v4 (Design tokens, Custom themes)
- **Animations**: Framer Motion
- **Icons**: Lucide React
- **State Management**: React Hooks, Vercel AI SDK (`useChat`)

### Backend & Database
- **Runtime**: Node.js / Next.js Server Actions & API Routes
- **Database**: Neon PostgreSQL (Serverless)
- **ORM**: Prisma
- **Authentication**: JWT (jsonwebtoken) & bcryptjs for secure password hashing

### AI Layer
- **Orchestration**: Vercel AI SDK
- **Model**: Llama 3.3 (via Groq Cloud)
- **Pattern**: Streaming Server-Sent Events (SSE) for low-latency AI responses

